EastSun 1003:
- "我搜尋視窗 要有可以替換關鍵字的功能": 取代為 + 取代 (the selected hit) + 全部取代
  (the hits listed). replaceHits: each hit placed by its offset in the document
  and replaced only if that text still matches; regex $1 groups; one
  WorkspaceEdit, nothing saved (全部儲存 / Ctrl+Z); golden / non-UTF-8 never; the
  replaced ones leave the list, the others after them in their file move by the
  length difference.
- "你要寫LOG紀錄 才能查異常" + "並且定時清理LOG": lib/filelog.js, one file a day in
  the extension's global storage (logs\htdesigner_YYYYMMDD.log): the output
  panel's lines (INFO), events (EVENT: F5 build start / done / failed / stopped,
  stop all, programs ended before F5, replaces, the find window hiding, this
  tree's wb_* running / gone), errors with the stack (every hub command is
  wrapped); older than log.keepDays (14) / over log.maxMB (50, oldest first,
  today's kept) removed at start and every 6 h; 開啟 LOG 資料夾.
- "永遠0%": 方案總管's 建置中 % reads F5's progress (refreshed as it moves);
  "請用不同顏色 不要反灰": building orange, running green, not greyed.
- "圖片上視窗不要了 刪掉": build.window off by default.
- vscode_it: the BtnPanelLane3 wait 60 s with the time and the selected id in
  the detail -- it waited the full 60 s with another component selected: not
  slow, BtnPanelLane3 is not selected (HANDOVER).

Tests: run_all 3/3 layers (lib 186, extension 235, panels); real VS Code
153/159 -- the 3 known stale checks + the BtnPanelLane3 set (see above; it
fails the same way before these changes).

